{"Title":"An Act relative to the bundled cell phone taxation","BillNumber":"H2709","DocketNumber":"HD1230","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"FJB1","Name":"F. Jay Barrows","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/FJB1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T11:36:15.747"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"FJB1","Name":"F. Jay Barrows","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/FJB1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T11:36:15.7466667"},{"Id":"DFD1","Name":"David F. DeCoste","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DFD1","ResponseDate":"2023-04-05T16:39:08.24"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H2709/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Barrows of Mansfield, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 2709) of F. Jay Barrows relative to the sales tax on mobile telecommunications devices purchased with a service contract.  Revenue.","DocumentText":"\tSection 1 of chapter 64H of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting after the word “services.” in line 283 the following new sentence: --\r\n\tIn the case of the sale by a vendor of a mobile telecommunications device with mobile telecommunications services, the tax shall be imposed upon the sales price of the mobile telecommunications device. \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J26","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J26"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}